# Sidecar binaries for Tauri `bundle.externalBin` (ffmpeg, Ghostscript).
#
# Blobs are gitignored — fetch before `npm run build`:
#   ./scripts/fetch-sidecars.sh
#
# Expected names (Tauri target-triple suffix):
#   ffmpeg-<rustc-host-triple>[.exe]
#   gs-<rustc-host-triple>[.exe]
#
# See README “Desktop packaging” and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
